# Everything prefixed VITE_ is copied into the public JavaScript bundle and can be
# read by anyone who opens the site. Only put public configuration here, never a
# server secret (sk_... keys, OpenAI/other AI keys, service account JSON, tokens).
# The build fails if a VITE_ variable looks like a secret. See docs/INTEGRATIONS.md.

# Clerk Authentication (publishable key only, never the sk_ secret key)
# Get your publishable key at https://dashboard.clerk.com
VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_your_clerk_publishable_key_here
